id: appmenu-print
section: Chrome, menus and dialogs
item: The app menu's Print: the card asks the daemon for printers and shows its dialog; the daemon's own discovery answers with the owner's network printer (its address in the log) and the dialog lists it — no page is printed by the round
shells: enyo mochi mojo
page: http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-card-events.html
kit: cavekit-ui-shell.md R7
calibrate bar
sample page 0,200,756,960
sample before-menu 0,30,300,180
chrome appmenu
wait differs 0,30,300,180 before-menu 5
wait still 0,30,300,180 3
chrome appmenu-print
wait line 'luna: findPrinters' 10
wait differs 0,200,756,960 page 5
wait log 'print: mdns: .* -> [0-9.]*:[0-9]*' 25
wait still 0,200,756,960 4
shoot print-dialog
